PSI-10,Raw Data,PSI-10_Raw Data_22035 test sheets.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-10/Raw Data/PSI-10_Raw Data_22035 test sheets.pdf,p16,0,"ACME / Flame Design (inverse flame) - Science Test Sheet Test date: Feb. 4, 2022 Local time: GMT: 22 035 22:21 ACME test #: 22035J7 Test of day #: 16 Flame of day #: 15 sustained Rack Officer (RO): [name omitted] DMO (CIR): [name omitted] PD (ACME): [name omitted] Researcher: [name omitted] TEST CONDITIONS Control?: fully automated Test type?: standard, other: TFP [inserted: but] to assess effect on flame [of] array inserted and for imaging not temp. Chamber atmosphere C2H4 conc.: ~10 % (vol, nominal) C2H4 conc.: 8.77 % (vol, per calc) Chamber pressure: 7.5 psia (CIR avg per FCU) Vent before?: no Also just before?: fan O2 bottle: 85% (volume) [printed] Burner O2 conc.: 85 % (volume) O2 flow rate: 0.172 slpm (N2 basis) N2 flow rate [printed ""N2 flow"" struck through]: 0 slpm — note: no N2 INSTRUMENTATION TFP?: fixed Gain: 25 DataCam 31 ops camera DataCam [marked]: filter? clear; ROI? full; fps: Intensified [marked]: filter? CH*; ROI? full; 23 fps HiBMs [label and box struck through]: backlight filter? yes CIR backlight?: no fps? [struck through] — note: no HiBMs FLAME BEHAVIOR Flame (hot / cool / maybe cool): hot Flame (hole/opening / partially detached): partially detached Flame (oscillating / unsteady / quasi-steady): oscillating, unsteady, quasi-steady [all three marked] Out (ext. detect / time out / temp. limit): [struck: ext. detect] time out [underlined] Ignited?: yes Soot@ignition: little — note: w/ ignition flash Soot@middle: not marked Soot@end:",,True
PSI-10,Raw Data,PSI-10_Raw Data_22035 test sheets.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-10/Raw Data/PSI-10_Raw Data_22035 test sheets.pdf,p16,1,"not marked POST-TEST CONDITIONS Fuel conc.: 8.67 % (vol, per calc) Valve safety timer: 17 sec Chamber pressure: psia (CIR avg per FCU) Oxidizer bottle pressure: ? psia GENERAL COMMENTS - J1+J6 variant (TFP variant of J5, but for imaging not temperature determination) - 1 fiber inside, 1 more just inside edge initially but well in after flame growth, third fiber visible throughout - weak oscillations at end of short test Form date: 19 Oct. 2021",,True
