PSI-10,Raw Data,PSI-10_Raw Data_22027B2_Comments.txt,data/raw/files/PSI-10/Raw Data/PSI-10_Raw Data_22027B2_Comments.txt,all,0,"1/31/2022 IPSUG Proxy Disconnected during the 22027B2 Test Point! IPSUG went through its ""retry"" process & did not re-connect. IPSUG went Bad Off, along with ACME & Intensified Camera Packages and Rack went Off Nominal. Used Aux Proc B.6 (steps 1 thru 8) in order to correct Off Nominal Condition and get IOP log files. Switched to Aux Proc. H.5 (minus step 4/power down) using script to Power on & configure IPSUG & Camera Packages Archive numbers prior to power cycle: ACME - 15 / Intensified - 391 Archive numbers after power cycle: ACME - 322 / Intensified - 9693",22027B2,False
