PSI-10,Raw Data,PSI-10_Raw Data_19123 flow traces etc dps.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-10/Raw Data/PSI-10_Raw Data_19123 flow traces etc dps.pdf,p1,0,"1 IMPORTANT – It is very likely that there are some errors in these notes. There were sometimes discrepancies in recorded values, in which case this edited version gave priority to the hand-written notes. In the case of possible omissions in the hand-written notes, priority was given to the raw version of this file – despite the possibility of copy & paste errors. At this time, the values have not been confirmed using the as-run parameter files. Test 19123A1 – successful test, run with bracketingExposureStartUsec=80000, bracketingExposureMultiplierTimes100=500, igniterIgnitionDurationMs=2500, igniterDelayBeforeRetractMs=2000 Also set igniter trigger level=2.5 V, igniter off delay=200 ms After test, 967 on lowest valve safety timer, 1058 psia in oxidizer bottle",,False
PSI-10,Raw Data,PSI-10_Raw Data_19123 flow traces etc dps.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-10/Raw Data/PSI-10_Raw Data_19123 flow traces etc dps.pdf,p2,0,"2 Test 19123A2 – successful test, run like A1 except for no fuel flow before igniter activation, i.e., with bracketingExposureStartUsec=80000, bracketingExposureMultiplierTimes100=500, igniterIgnitionDurationMs=2500, igniterDelayBeforeRetractMs=2000, fuelFlowIgnitionDeltaMs=0 After test, 937 on lowest valve safety timer, 1061 psia in oxidizer bottle",,False
PSI-10,Raw Data,PSI-10_Raw Data_19123 flow traces etc dps.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-10/Raw Data/PSI-10_Raw Data_19123 flow traces etc dps.pdf,p3,0,"3 Test 19123A3 – successful test, run like A1 except for no fuel flow before igniter activation and a different igniter position, i.e., with bracketingExposureStartUsec=80000, bracketingExposureMultiplierTimes100=500, igniterIgnitionPosition=2250, igniterIgnitionDurationMs=2500, igniterDelayBeforeRetractMs=2000, fuelFlowIgnitionDeltaMs=0 After test, __ on lowest valve safety timer, __ psia in oxidizer bottle",,False
PSI-10,Raw Data,PSI-10_Raw Data_19123 flow traces etc dps.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-10/Raw Data/PSI-10_Raw Data_19123 flow traces etc dps.pdf,p4,0,"4 Test 19123A4 – successful test, run like A3 except for igniter position and igniter detection threshold , i.e., with bracketingExposureStartUsec=80000, bracketingExposureMultiplierTimes100=500, igniterIgnitionPosition=2200, igniterIgnitionDurationMs=2500, igniterDelayBeforeRetractMs=2000 fuelFlowIgnitionDeltaMs=0 Also ignition detection trigger=2 V Lost telemetry data on science console; had to reboot. After test, __ on lowest valve safety timer, __ psia in oxidizer bottle Test 19123C1 – successful test, run with bracketingExposureStartUsec=80000, bracketingExposureMultiplierTimes100=500, igniterIgnitionPosition=2200, igniterIgnitionDurationMs=2500, igniterDelayBeforeRetractMs=2000 Also ACME camera zoom and focus like in A1, i.e., dataCamera Focus=12700, dataCamera Zoom=35000. Also set igniter trigger level= 2.0 V, Igniter Off Delay= 200 ms Lost display on science computer except for video. After test, 836 on lowest valve safety timer, 1064 psia in oxidizer bottle",,False
