PSI-23,Presentations,PSI-23_Presentations_ACME_ASGSR_20131107.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Presentations/PSI-23_Presentations_ACME_ASGSR_20131107.pdf,p23,0,National Aeronautics and Space Administration www.nasa.gov 23 Additional Diagnostics • Heat Flux (to BRE burners) • Temperature – Burner (with 1-2 TCs) – Far-Field • 2 fixed thermocouples (TCs) • rake with 4 TCs is crew removable or swappable for different TC positions • Ion Current (electric field tests only) • Post-Test Gas Composition MDCA and CIR Thermocouple rake and 2 fixed thermocouples,,False
