PSI-23,Presentations,PSI-23_Presentations_ACME_ASGSR_20131107.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Presentations/PSI-23_Presentations_ACME_ASGSR_20131107.pdf,p25,0,"National Aeronautics and Space Administration www.nasa.gov 25 Nominal Operational Sequence • Flow > Ignite > Measure > Extinguish – Initiate burner flows at ignition condition – Ignite flame • Wait for flame to stabilize – If needed, adjust flows to (initial) test condition • Wait for flame to stabilize – If desired: • increase or decrease burner flow(s) – to vary flow/velocity or concentration • activate and adjust electric field • translate TFP array – Stop burner flows • per extinction detection, test duration, etc. • Control can be automated or “manual” Nicole Stott with CIR",,False
