PSI-23,Reference Data,PSI-23_Reference Data_ACME-DOC-010_D.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Reference Data/PSI-23_Reference Data_ACME-DOC-010_D.pdf,p3,0,"ACME-DOC-010 Rev D iii REVISIONS ACME SOFTWARE INTERFACE DESIGN DESCRIPTION Revision Letter Publication Date Change Description Approval − 11/2013 Baseline Release A 02/2016 Major expansion to include detailed information about commands, telmetry, files, and interfaces. B 05/2016 Filled in extinction detection commands. Changes to telemetry packet. Changes to registry values. ACME-ECO-611 EM 5/16/2016 BB 5/16/2016 C 08/2016 Added system script commands. Added 3rd order to EField control voltage equation. Changes to telemetry packet. Changes to registry values. EM 8/30/2016 BB 8/30/2016 D 09/2017 Updates to commands and telemetry to reflect state of software during initial operations. EM 9/25/2017 BB 9/25/2017",,False
