PSI-23,Science Documents,PSI-23_Science Documents_ACME Integrated Science Requirements Definition Review 20100505.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Science Documents/PSI-23_Science Documents_ACME Integrated Science Requirements Definition Review 20100505.pdf,p5,0,"National Aeronautics and Space Administration ACME Conceptp • ACME experiments all use laminar gaseous diffusion flames • Conduct them using a single modular insert for the Combustion Integrated Rack (CIR) on the International Space Station (ISS) – The only currently existing insert is for droplet combustion experiments www.nasa.gov 5 Koichi Wakata with MDCA in CIR (left), ISS (right)",,False
