PSI-23,Science Documents,PSI-23_Science Documents_ACME Integrated Science Requirements Definition Review 20100505.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Science Documents/PSI-23_Science Documents_ACME Integrated Science Requirements Definition Review 20100505.pdf,p39,0,"National Aeronautics and Space Administration Major Changes since SCRajo C a ges s ce SC • Added – Inverse spherical flame testing (tentative, assuming safety approval)pg( ,gypp) – Color imaging for operations (i.e., with near real-time downlink) • Eliminated (where most items were desired) Diti– Dynamic venting – Oxygen measurement (other than via GCIP) – Burner gas temperature measurement – CH* imaging – IR imaging – Schlieren or shadowgraph imagingSchlieren or shadowgraph imaging • Other Changes – Reduced maximum oxygen in chamber from 50% to 40% www.nasa.gov 39",,False
