PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p44,0,"ACME Engineering Requirements Document ACME-REQ-001 rev. K April, 2014 Page 37 of 117 System SSC_ID ISRD Trace ERD REQ Title/Description BURNER 530_0920 1.4.9.a. 1.4.11 1.4.11.3 Coflow Flow Profile – Axisymmetric Velocities Not Matched 50:10 ACME shall provide a flow profile of the coflow burner that have a uniform, axisymmetric flow profile at 1g using a cold flow, with no flame, such that the variation in axial velocity with angular position is less than 10% of the mean velocity for select radial positions from 0 to 10mm across one 30mm diameter orthogonal to the burner axis that is within 0.5mm downstream of the inner tube outlet; at increments of no greater than 1mm within 5mm of the burner axis and at no greater than 5mm thereafter; for velocities, in cm/s, not matched in the inner and outer tubes at 50:10 respectively. BURNER 530_0930 1.4.9.a. 1.4.11 1.4.11.3 Coflow Flow Profile – Axisymmetric Velocities Not Matched 50:30 ACME shall provide a flow profile of the coflow burner that have a uniform, axisymmetric flow profile at 1g using a cold flow, with no flame, such that the variation in axial velocity with angular position is less than 10% of the mean velocity for select radial positions from 0 to 10mm across one 30mm diameter orthogonal to the burner axis that is within 0.5mm downstream of the inner tube outlet; at increments of no greater than 1mm within 5mm of the burner axis and at no greater than 5mm thereafter;",,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p44,1,"for velocities, in cm/s, not matched in the inner and outer tubes at 50:30 respectively. BURNER 530_0940 1.4.9.b. 1.4.11 1.4.11.1 Coflow Flow Profile – Parallel Ejection, 20 cm/s ACME shall provide a flow profile of the coflow burner such that the burner gas is ejected parallel to the chamber axis, at 1g using a cold flow – with no flame, without either swirl – helically rotating flow, or turbulence – eddies, where the axial velocity at any position across one diameter 0.5mm downstream of the inner tube outlet is constant with time within 3% of the time-averaged value; for a matched velocity in the inner and outer tubes of 20 cm/s. BURNER 530_0950 1.4.9.b. 1.4.11 1.4.11.1 Coflow Flow Profile – Parallel Ejection, 30 cm/s ACME shall provide a flow profile of the coflow burner such that the burner gas is ejected parallel to the chamber axis, at 1g using a cold flow – with no flame, without either swirl – helically rotating flow, or turbulence – eddies, where the axial velocity at any position across one diameter 0.5mm downstream of the inner tube outlet is constant with time within 3% of the time-averaged value; for a matched velocity in the inner and outer tubes of 30 cm/s.",,False
