PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p106,0,"ACME Engineering Requirements Document ACME-REQ-001 rev. K April, 2014 Page 99 of 117 System SSC_ID Parent ID/ ISRD Trace Ops Requirement Trace ERD REQ Title/Description FLOW AMP 521_1340 1.9.1 1.9.2 1.9.4 1.11.1 4.1 4.2 4.3 4.4 4.6 9.1 9.2 9.3 9.4 9.5 9.6 9.7 9.8 9.9 9.10 9.11 Flow System - Solenoid Valve A8 - Enable/Disable Configured The AMP CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure SV A8 by applying a voltage of 0V or +5V through channel AO22. FLOW AGS 522_1350 1.9.1 1.9.2 1.9.4 1.11.1 4.1 4.2 4.3 4.4 4.6 9.1 9.2 9.3 9.4 9.5 9.6 9.7 9.8 9.9 9.10 9.11 Flow System - Solenoid Valve A9 - Enable/Disable Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure SV A9 enable/disable. FLOW AMP 521_1360 1.9.1 1.9.2 1.9.4 1.11.1 4.1 4.2 4.3 4.4 4.6 9.1 9.2 9.3 9.4 9.5 9.6 9.7 9.8 9.9 9.10 9.11 Flow System - Solenoid Valve A9 - Enable/Disable Configured The AMP CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure SV A9 by applying a voltage of 0V or +5V through channel AO23. FLOW AMP 521_0770 2.3.3 5.4 Gas Flow Rate – Sampling Frequency The AMP CSCI shall collect gas flow measurements for all mass flow controllers at 10Hz.",,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p107,0,"ACME Engineering Requirements Document ACME-REQ-001 rev. K April, 2014 Page 100 of 117 System SSC_ID Parent ID/ ISRD Trace Ops Requirement Trace ERD REQ Title/Description FLOW AGS 522_1370 2.3.3 2.3.4 5.4 Mass Flow Controller A1 - Telemetry Display The AGS CSCI shall display gas flow measurements for MFC A1. FLOW AMP 521_1380 2.3.3 2.3.4 5.4 Mass Flow Controller A1 - Telemetry Report The AMP CSCI shall report gas flow measurements for MFC A1 by reading a voltage of 0V to +5V from channel Ain-0 (207). FLOW AGS 522_1390 2.3.3 2.3.4 5.4 Mass Flow Controller A2 - Telemetry Display The AGS CSCI shall display gas flow measurements for MFC A2. FLOW AMP 521_1400 2.3.3 2.3.4 5.4 Mass Flow Controller A2 - Telemetry Report The AMP CSCI shall report gas flow measurements for MFC A2 by reading a voltage of 0V to +5V from channel Ain-1 (207.) FLOW AGS 522_1410 2.3.3 2.3.4 5.4 Mass Flow Controller A3 - Telemetry Display The AGS CSCI shall display gas flow measurements for MFC A3. FLOW AMP 521_1420 2.3.3 2.3.4 5.4 Mass Flow Controller A3 - Telemetry Report The AMP CSCI shall report gas flow measurements for MFC A3 by reading a voltage of 0V to +5V from channel Ain-2 (207.) Igniter IGN AGS 542_0230 1.10.2 1.10.3 1.10.4 8.1 8.2 Igniter - Enable/Disable - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the igniter enable/disable.",,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p107,1,IGN AMP 541_0240 1.10.2 1.10.3 1.10.4 8.1 8.2 Igniter - Enable/Disable - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the igniter enable/disable by applying a voltage of 0V or +5V through channel AO7. IGN AGS 542_0250 1.10.2 1.10.3 1.10.4 8.1 8.2 Igniter Stepper Reset - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the igniter stepper reset. IGN AMP 541_0260 1.10.2 1.10.3 1.10.4 8.1 8.2 Igniter Stepper Reset - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the igniter stepper reset by applying a voltage of 0V or +5V through channel AO14. IGN AGS 542_0270 1.10.2 1.10.3 1.10.4 8.1 8.2 Igniter Deployment - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the igniter position.,,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p108,0,"ACME Engineering Requirements Document ACME-REQ-001 rev. K April, 2014 Page 101 of 117 System SSC_ID Parent ID/ ISRD Trace Ops Requirement Trace ERD REQ Title/Description IGN AMP 541_0280 1.10.2 1.10.3 1.10.4 8.1 8.2 Igniter Deployment - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the igniter position. IGN AGS 542_0290 1.10.3 1.10.4 8.2 Igniter Output Voltage Control - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the igniter output voltage for a specified duration. IGN AMP 541_0300 1.10.3 1.10.4 8.2 Igniter Output Voltage Control - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the igniter output voltage for a specified duration by applying a voltage of 0V to +.4V through channel AO8. ACME Data Camera MCS AMP 611_0040 1.12.3 5.5 Data Recording – Imaging Duration Default Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure all imaging measurements to begin at an uplinked time that is at most 1 minute prior to ignition and continues to an uplinked time at most 1 minute after extinction detection. DataCam AGS 312_0570 3.2.7 3.2.8 5.3 ACME Data Camera - Field of View (Focus) - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the data camera's focus. DataCam AMP 311_0580 3.2.7 3.2.8 5.3 Data Camera - Field of View (Focus) - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the data camera's focus.",,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p108,1,DataCam AGS 312_0180 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Bit Depth - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the digital color camera's Bit Depth. DataCam AMP 311_0170 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Bit Depth - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the digital color camera's Bit Depth. DataCam AGS 312_0210 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Gain - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the digital color camera's Gain. DataCam AMP 311_0200 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Gain - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the digital color camera's Gain. DataCam AGS 312_0240 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Iris - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the digital color camera's iris.,,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p109,0,"ACME Engineering Requirements Document ACME-REQ-001 rev. K April, 2014 Page 102 of 117 System SSC_ID Parent ID/ ISRD Trace Ops Requirement Trace ERD REQ Title/Description DataCam AMP 311_0230 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Iris - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the digital color camera's iris. DataCam AGS 312_0270 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Exposure Time - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the digital color camera's exposure time. DataCam AMP 311_0260 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Exposure Time - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the digital color camera's exposure time. DataCam AGS 312_0300 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Frame Rate - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the digital color camera's frame rate. DataCam AMP 311_0290 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Frame Rate - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the digital color camera's frame rate. DataCam AGS 312_0330 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Binning - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the digital color camera's binning. DataCam AMP 311_0320 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Binning - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the digital color camera's binning. DataCam AGS 312_0360 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Region Of Interest (ROI) - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the digital color camera's region of interest (ROI).",,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p109,1,DataCam AMP 311_0350 3.2.13 5.3 Data Camera - Region Of Interest (ROI) - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the digital color camera's region of interest (ROI). DataCam AGS 312_0590 3.2.11 5.2 Data Camera - Filter Barrel - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the digital camera's filter barrel. DataCam AMP 311_0600 3.2.11 5.2 Data Camera - Filter Barrel - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the digital camera's filter barrel. ACME Analog Camera/ Illumination Package,,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p110,0,"ACME Engineering Requirements Document ACME-REQ-001 rev. K April, 2014 Page 103 of 117 System SSC_ID Parent ID/ ISRD Trace Ops Requirement Trace ERD REQ Title/Description OpsCam AGS 552_0050 3.1.4 5.3 Analog Camera - Gain - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure the analog operations camera's gain (iris.) OpsCam AMP 551_0060 3.1.4 5.3 Analog Camera - Gain -Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command the analog operations camera's gain (iris.) OpsCam AGS 552_0090 3.1.8 6.1 6.2 6.3 Illumination Package Bank 1 - Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure LED bank 1 of the illumination package. OpsCam AMP 551_0100 3.1.8 6.1 6.2 6.3 Illumination Package Bank 1 - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command LED bank 1 of the illumination package by applying a voltage of 0V to +5V through channel AO28. OpsCam AGS 552_0130 3.1.8 6.1 6.2 6.3 Illumination Package Bank 2- Commanded The AGS CSCI shall provide an uplinkable command to configure LED bank 2 of the illumination package. OpsCam AMP 551_0140 3.1.8 6.1 6.2 6.3 Illumination Package Bank 2 - Configured The AMP CSCI shall configure upon command LED bank 2 of the illumination package by applying a voltage of 0V to +5V through channel AO29. Diagnostics DIAG AMP 571_0800 3.6.7 5.4 12.1 Radiant Emission – Sampling Frequency The AMP CSCI shall collect radiant emission measurements from all thermopiles at 60 Hz.",,False
