PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p116,0,"ACME Engineering Requirements Document ACME-REQ-001 rev. K April, 2014 Page 109 of 117 System SSC_ID Parent ID/ ISRD Trace Ops Requirement Trace ERD REQ Title/Description DIAG AMP 571_0500 3.7.1 3.7.5 12.1 12.2 12.3 12.4 12.5 12.6 12.7 Photomultiplier Tube 3 - Telemetry Report The AMP CSCI shall report chemiluminescent emission measurements from PMT3 by reading a voltage of 0V to +4V on channel Ain-10 (207.) Measurement System MEAS AMP 571_0090 2.4.3 1.6 5.4 Pressure Measurement – Sampling Frequency The AMP CSCI shall collect pressure measurement from all pressure transducers at 10 Hz. MEAS AGS 572_0510 4.0 1.6 5.4 Pressure Transducer 1 - Telemetry Display The AGS CSCI shall display pressure measurements for PT1 from the telemetry report. MEAS AMP 571_0410 2.4.3 1.6 5.4 Pressure Transducer 1 - Telemetry Report The AMP CSCI shall report pressure measurements for PT1 by reading a voltage of 0V - +5V from channel Ain-4 (207.) MEAS AGS 572_0520 4.0 1.6 5.4 Pressure Transducer 2 - Telemetry Display The AGS CSCI shall display pressure measurements for PT2 from the telemetry report. MEAS AMP 571_0530 2.4.3 1.6 5.4 Pressure Transducer 2 - Telemetry Report The AMP CSCI shall report pressure measurements for PT2 by reading a voltage of 0V - +5V from channel Ain-5 (207.) MEAS AGS 572_0540 4.0 1.6 5.4 Pressure Transducer 3 - Telemetry Display The AGS CSCI shall display pressure measurements for PT3 from the telemetry report.",,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p116,1,MEAS AMP 571_0550 2.4.3 1.6 5.4 Pressure Transducer 3 - Telemetry Report The AMP CSCI shall report pressure measurements for PT3 by reading a voltage of 0V - +5V from channel Ain-6 (207.) MEAS AMP 571_0310 3.4.4.8 1.6 5.4 12.1 Temperature Measurement - Sampling Frequency The AMP CSCI shall collect temperature measurements from all thermocouples at 1 Hz.,,False
