PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME - Engineering Requirements Doc Rev K.pdf,p123,0,"ACME Engineering Requirements Document ACME-REQ-001 rev. K April, 2014 Page 116 of 117 APPENDIX A ACRONYMS AND ABBREVIATIONS <APPENDIX> A.1 Scope This appendix lists the acronyms and abbreviations used in this document. Table A-1—Acronyms 1g 1 time gravitational force A amp ACME Advanced Combustion via Microgravity Experiments Atm Atmosphere BRE Burning Rate Emulator C Celsius CDR Critical Design Review CIA Chamber Insert Assembly CIR Combustion Integration Rack cm Centimeter ConOps Concept of Operations Document EMS Experiment Mounting Structure ERD Engineering Requirements Document FCF Fluids and Combustion Facility FOMA Fuel/Oxidizer Management Assembly FOV Field of View Fps Frames per second GRC Glenn Research Center HiBMS High Bit-Depth Multi-Spectral HV High Voltage Hz Hertz ICD Interface Control Document ID Identification IOP Input/ Output Processor IRR Interface Resource Ring ISS International Space Station K Kelvin kV Kilovolt MDCA Multi-user Droplet Combustion Apparatus MFC Mass flow controller Min Minute mm millimeter ms millisecond",,False
