PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME_engineering_20210328.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME_engineering_20210328.pdf,p94,1,"7. Nomenclature ACME Advanced Combustion via Microgravity Experiments (project conducted in the CIR) ADP Acceptance Data Package AVP avionics package BRE Burning Rate Emulator (an ACME experiment) CASIS Center for the Advancement of Science in Space CCD Charge-Coupled Device (such as a camera sensor) CIA Chamber Insert Assembly (inserted into the CIR combustion chamber) CIR Combustion Integrated Rack (ISS facility in which ACME experiments are conducted) CFI Cool Flames Investigation (an MDCA experiment preceding ACME in the CIR) CFI-G Cool Flames Investigation with Gases (an ACME experiment selected by CASIS and NSF) CLD Flame Coflow Laminar Diffusion Flame (an ACME experiments) CM Combustion Module (space shuttle precursor to the CIR) CSV comma-separated values DataCam Data Camera (developed for the ACME experiments, characterized for pyrometry, etc.) E-FIELD Flames Electric-Field Effects on Laminar Diffusion Flames (an ACME experiment) EMI electromagnetic interference",,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME_engineering_20210328.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME_engineering_20210328.pdf,p95,0,ACME Engineering Implementation 28 March 2021 95 EMS Experiment Mounting Structure ERD Engineering Requirements Document Fiji Fiji Is Just ImageJ (a version of ImageJ preloaded with many plug-in features) Flame Design Flame Design (an ACME experiment) FOMA Fuel and Oxidizer Management Assembly (CIR’s gas management subsystem) FOV field of view fps frames per second GCIP Gas Chromatograph Instrumentation Package (a CIR subsystem) GIPOC Glenn ISS Payload Operations Center (also known as the TSC) GMT Greenwich Mean Time HiBMs High Bit-depth Multi-spectral camera (developed for the CIR facility) HOBJ Halcon object (binary uncompressed format;,,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME_engineering_20210328.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME_engineering_20210328.pdf,p95,1,used for the DataCam) HV high voltage ImageJ Image Processing and Analysis in Java (open-source image processing software) IPSU Image Processing and Storage Unit (a CIR subsystem) IPSU-G IPSU for Gigabit ethernet cameras ISRD Integrated Science Requirements Document (for a set of experiments) ISS International Space Station LLL-UV Low Light Level Ultraviolet camera ((developed for the CIR facility) LSP Laminar Soot Processes (a shuttle experiment conducted in the Combustion Module) MDCA Multi-user Droplet Combustion Apparatus (CIR chamber insert preceding ACME) MFC mass flow controller Mist Water-Mist Fire Suppression Experiment (a Combustion Module experiment) MIUL Materials Identification/Usage List NSF National Science Foundation NTSC National Television System Committee OMA2 Optical Multi-channel Analyzer 2 (open-source software for image processing and display) ops operations PaRIS Passive Rack Isolation System PIMS Principal Investigator Microgravity Services PMT Photomultiplier Tube (where ACME is equipped with three PMT modules) PSI Physical Sciences Informatics System PT pressure transducer psia pounds per square inch QD quick disconnect qty quantity s-Flame Structure and Response of Spherical Diffusion Flames (an ACME experiment) SAMS Space Acceleration Measurement System SDP Safety Data Package slpm standard liters per minute (a measure of the mass or molar flow rate of a gas) SOFBALL Structure Of Flame Balls At Low Lewis-number (a Combustion Module experiment),,False
