PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_s1101mfa1800_B.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_s1101mfa1800_B.pdf,p1,0,"Description: Cold Plate Assembly drawing: isometric view of a rectangular aluminium cold plate with a U-shaped embedded tube and two 90° Swagelok union elbows; top view with section line A-A; Section A-A showing tube channels filled with RTV; side view; and a plan view. Commercial parts list, drawing list, notes, revision block and title block. ### COMMERCIAL PARTS LIST | ITEM | QTY | PART NUMBER | DESCRIPTION | |---|---|---|---| | C1 | 2 | SS-600-9 | 3/8 IN. TUBE 90° UNION ELBOW, 316 SSTL, SWAGELOK | | C2 | 6 | MS51830CA103L | MINIATURE INSERT, LOCKING FOR .138-32 UNJC-3A IN. FASTENER | | C3 | A/R | 3140 RTV | SILICONE ELASTOMER, DOW CORNING | | C4 | A/R | 3145 GRAY | RTV ADHESIVE/SEALANT, GRAY, DOW CORNING | ### DRAWING LIST | ITEM | QTY | DRAWING NUMBER | DESCRIPTION | |---|---|---|---| | 1 | 1 | S1101MFP1801 | ALTERED COLD PLATE | ### Views and callouts - Isometric view: balloon 1 (cold plate); C2 (inserts); C1 with flag 9 (elbow fittings) - Top view with section cutting plane A — A - SECTION A-A: C3 with flag 4 and flag 11 (two callouts, tube channels) - Plan view: flag 5 (open ends of the two fittings) - Side view: C4 with flag 4 and flag 10 (two callouts, channel ends)",,True
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_s1101mfa1800_B.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_s1101mfa1800_B.pdf,p1,1,"### NOTES 1. CERTIFICATE OF CONFORMANCE REQUIRED FOR ALL COMMERCIAL PARTS. 2. INSTALL THREADED INSERTS PER MS51835. 3. SURFACE TREAT ANY DAMAGED OR MACHINED AREAS ON ALUMINUM PARTS PER MIL-DTL-5541, TYPE I, CLASS 3. (GOLD COLOR) CERTIFICATE OF CONFORMANCE REQUIRED. 4. (flag) APPLY ITEM RTV TO AREAS NOTED. DRY COMPONENT THOROUGHLY BEFORE APPLYING. 5. (flag) APPLY KAPTON TAPE TO OPEN END OF FITTING TO PROTECT EXPOSED PORT FROM CONTAMINATION AND PREVENT NUT FROM ROTATING DURING HANDLING AND STORAGE. 6. CLEAN ALL SURFACES WITH ISOPROPYL OR ETHYL ALCOHOL AND LET AIR DRY. WIPE WITH CLEAN COTTON SWABS AND/OR LINT FREE CLOTH. 7. HANDLE WITH CLEAN LINT FREE GLOVES. 8. BEFORE STORAGE, PROTECT WITH CONTAMINATION BARRIER. USE CLEAN, NEW, TRANSPARENT POLYETHYLENE BAG FOR SMALL ITEMS OR 4 MIL THICK MINIMUM POLYETHYLENE SHEET AND SEAL. IDENTIFY PART BY TAGGING WITH PART NUMBER AND SERIAL/LOT NUMBER AS SPECIFIED IN WORK ORDER PER SAE AS478, METHOD 35. 9. (flag) INSTALL C1 FITTINGS PER MANUFACTURER RECOMMENDATIONS. 10. (flag) USE C4 RTV TO SEAL ENDS OF EACH CHANNEL TO PREVENT C3 RTV FROM LEAKING OUT. 11. (flag) FIL ENTIRE CHANNEL WITH C3 RTV ONCE ENDS ARE CAPPED. ### REVISIONS | CHG | ZONE | DESCRIPTION | APP/DATE | |---|---|---|---| | B | | INCORPORATED ACME-ECO-427 | [name omitted] 6/22/16, 6/23/16, 6/24/16 | | A | | INCORPORATED ACME-ECO-370 | [name omitted] 9/17/14, 9/19/14, 9/18/14 |",,True
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_s1101mfa1800_B.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_s1101mfa1800_B.pdf,p1,2,"### TITLE BLOCK - UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED DIMENSIONS ARE IN INCHES. TOLERANCE ON: .X ± 0.03; .XX ± 0.01; .XXX ± 0.005; FRACTION ± -; ANGULAR ± 0.50°; BREAK EDGES N/A - DIMENSIONING AND TOLERANCING PER ASME Y14.5M-1994 - ZIN TECHNOLOGIES [address and phone omitted] - PROJECT LEAD [name omitted] 02/22/11; QUALITY [name omitted] 02/22/11; SAFETY [name omitted] 02/22/11; ENGINEER [name omitted] 02/18/11; DESIGNER [name omitted] 02/18/11; REVIEWER [name omitted] 02/18/11 - CONTRACT NUMBER: NNC09BA02B; DELIVERY ORDER: SPACE 110; MODEL NAME: S1101MFA1800 - THIS DRAWING IS UNDER CONFIGURATION CONTROL: DO NOT REVISE WITHOUT APPROVED ECO. APPROVED: [name omitted] DATE: 6/23/16 - PRIOR TO USE CHECK FOR ANY OUTSTANDING ECO'S WITH CONFIGURATION MANAGEMENT OFFICE - NATIONAL AERONAUTICS AND SPACE ADMINISTRATION, JOHN H. GLENN RESEARCH CENTER, LEWIS FIELD, CLEVELAND, OHIO - Next assembly / title line: ACME CHAMBER INSERT ASSEMBLY, S1101MFA0003 - TITLE: COLD PLATE ASSEMBLY - SIZE D; DRAWING NUMBER S1101MFA1800; REV B; BLDG ZIN; AREA GRC; UNITS: INCH - SCALE: 1/1; INITIAL REL DATE 02/22/2011; SHEET 1 OF 1; DISCIPLINE MECHANICAL - PRO/E VERSION: Wildfire 2.0",,True
