PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_s-Flame_RDR_201005.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_s-Flame_RDR_201005.pdf,p31,0,"Justification for Space-Flight s-Flame • High-quality and sufficient duration microgravity Facility • Transient evolution to “steady-state” • Radiative extinction • Flame instability • Multi-staged flow for kinetic extinction • Computation comparison (need 1-D flames) • Diagnostics afforded, KEY Æ Flame structure UV i i• UV imaging • Radiometer • Temperature profile 3030 • Temperature profile",,False
