PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_s-Flame_RDR_201005.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_s-Flame_RDR_201005.pdf,p34,0,"Operation Sequence s-Flame I. Establish chamber at constant pressure and species tti pq concentration II. Discharge fuel mixture through porous burner at initial flow rate III. Ignite fuel mixture and retract upon successful ignitiong p g IV. Allow for spherical diffusion flame to evolve V. Apply one of the following: iifl ih iiili fd i f Maintain flow rate with same initial mixture for duration of experiment (25s) or until extinction  Single step decrease in flow rate with same initial mixture at gp specified time, maintaining new flow rate for duration of experiment (25s) or until extinction VI Terminate fuel supply to burner after 25s 3333 VI. Terminate fuel supply to burner after 25s.",,False
