PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,p89,0,ACME Critical Design Review– 94 Glenn Research Center ZIN Technologies AVP Command and Control 94 ACME Single Board Computer will coordinate CIR diagnostic hardware and control ACME hardware: •Intel Core 2 Duo Processor 1066 MHz •1GB DDR3 RAM onboard • Ethernet Ports •1 port receives commands and transmits telemetry from and to the CIR Input Output Processor (IOP) •1 port sends control signals and receives data acquisition packets from data acquisition “Cube” located in ACME Chamber Insert Assembly. • 1 port receives video from digital camera package. •RS 232 Ports •Transmits commands to ACME Chamber insert Color camera. •Controls Motion Control Boards/Stepper Motors. •RS 422 Port • Communicates to Mass Flow Controllers – monitoring operation/functionality.,,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,p90,0,"ACME Critical Design Review– 95 Glenn Research Center ZIN Technologies AVP Control and Data Management 95 • Two 4 Axis Motor Control Boards coordinate actuation of ACME motors to perform input/output functions: • Insert and retract position of igniter and Thin Film Pyrometry (TFM) • Digital camera zoom, iris, focus control and filter insertion • Cube Analog input (differential inputs) and outputs (single ended) collect experiment telemetry and provide hardware control. • Analog Outputs • D/A Cube +5 – 0 outputs to relay boards provide the discrete I/O channels to chamber – on/off, enable/disable to MFCs, valves, igniters, both stepper drives, illumination, High Voltage and a variable output to control MFC, High Voltage, Photomultiplier gains. • Analog Inputs • Collects Radiometer, Photomultiplier, Gas flow rates, Multiple Temperature points data, Ion Current and High Voltage Grid measurements.",,False
