PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,p120,0,"ACME Critical Design Review– 125 Glenn Research Center ZIN Technologies Common Platform • Projects all have similar needs: • Operating system, libraries • Command and Telemetry Handling, Communications • Logging, Serial Port Communication • Hardware control, experiment sequencing • Development environment • The Common Software Platform provides a standard, easy to use, free platform for NASA projects • Relies heavily on free and open source software (FOSS) • Provides a directly reusable common software architecture",,False
