PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,p124,0,"ACME Critical Design Review– 129 Glenn Research Center ZIN Technologies Linux OS • Linux – Operating System • Highly successful, stable OS • Highly configurable • Many distributions • Lots of free libraries and tools • Easy to upgrade • Lubuntu – A lighter Ubuntu distribution with LXDE desktop",,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,p125,0,"ACME Critical Design Review– 130 Glenn Research Center ZIN Technologies Qt Framework • Qt is a cross-platform application and UI framework • Cross-platform means programs built on Qt can be compiled on other OSes with little to no work • Linux, Windows, QNX, VXWorks, Android, Mac, iOS • “Write once, build everywhere” • Provides many capabilities: • Threading and Concurrency • Networking and Sockets • Timers • String manipulation, File Systems, etc • Event driven architecture • Signals and slots • Hundreds of 3rd party Qt libraries",,False
PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,p126,0,"ACME Critical Design Review– 131 Glenn Research Center ZIN Technologies Common Classes • Common C++ Software – developed to share between projects • All directly useable without modification • Very low coupling due to Qt signals/slots • Hardware interface classes • AVT GigE Camera • PowerDNA Cube • PMD Motion Control • Software Architecture • Avionics controller, System Controller, hardware interface • Command and Telemetry message serialization/deserialization • Logging • GUI elements",,False
