PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,p138,0,ACME Critical Design Review– 143 Glenn Research Center ZIN Technologies Structural Analysis – Crew Loading ACME Color Camera Package can be loaded up to 125 lbf Z Direction X Direction • Structural components created and assembled in FEA for X and Z direction kick loads • Equivalent pressure load of 125 lbf applied at the top to generate the largest worst case moment • Model constrained at the bottom to represent it’s connection to the CIR optics bench • Crew Loading will envelope loads due to launch,,False
