PSI-23,Engineering Documents,PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-23/Engineering Documents/PSI-23_Engineering Documents_ACME CDR_Presentation_Package.pdf,p202,0,"ACME Critical Design Review– 207 Glenn Research Center ZIN Technologies Summary of Operations Experiment # Test Points # OPS Days Required # Weeks Crew time CLD Flame 82 54 22 53.08* E-Field 58 38 18 36.58 Flame Design 76 64 27 56.75 s-Flame 46 37 19 37.92 BRE 73 60 23 41.33 TOTAL 335 253 109 225.66 Assumptions: • OPS Day = test point, transfer/downlink or crew ops • 3 powered ops days per week • 1 powered ops day with 1 crew ops day per week • 2 – 5 test points per day • 30 – 70 second test point durations • Transfer/downlink after every test point day *Includes initial configure",,False
