PSI-26,Presentations,PSI-26_Presentations_Flammability Aspects of Fabric_USNationalCombustion2013.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-26/Presentations/PSI-26_Presentations_Flammability Aspects of Fabric_USNationalCombustion2013.pdf,p17,0,"Sample Images Digital Still Video Hardware Summary:  BASS utilized the on-orbit SPICE hardware; minor modifications were made to burn solid samples  Small flow tunnel  Solid samples were installed, ignited, extinguished, and recorded  Video and digital still camera provided bulk of the data. Flame appearance, behavior, spread rate, and extinction dynamics were measured  Airflow speed was the main variable Airflow",,False
