PSI-26,Presentations,PSI-26_Presentations_Crew Training 2010.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-26/Presentations/PSI-26_Presentations_Crew Training 2010.pdf,p13,0,SPICE Hardware – Experiment Assembly cont’d Experiment Assembly features: • Mounts to floor of MSG bridging cold plate and airlock lid • Flow tunnel for flame and air stream • Air stream fan driven with ceramic flow straightener • Anemometer for air stream • Soot trap on air stream exit of flow tunnel • Top and front windows for flame view • Front window opens for burner tube and igniter changeout • Redundant fuel enable switch • Levers for focus target deploy and igniter actuation • Front window interlocks to prevent igniter or fuel actuation 13,,False
