PSI-26,Engineering Documents,PSI-26_Engineering Documents_BASS_SysAcceptanceReview.1.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-26/Engineering Documents/PSI-26_Engineering Documents_BASS_SysAcceptanceReview.1.pdf,p30,0,"BASS HARDWARE OVERVIEW • BASS will utilize the SPICE hardware currently on ISS – Experiment Assembly, Cables, Video Camera • BASS will utilize the SLICE Still Camera • BASS will design, fab, assemble, test new hardware – Modified 3.2 mm burner tube – GN2 Hose Assembly – Sample Frame Assembly Insert for Experiment Assembly – 4 different fuel holder designs for a total of 41 fuel samples – BASS Control Box – Fan Flow Block Assembly – Ignitor Wire Extension Assembly 4/14/2010 30",,False
