PSI-26,Engineering Documents,PSI-26_Engineering Documents_BASS_SysAcceptanceReview.2.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-26/Engineering Documents/PSI-26_Engineering Documents_BASS_SysAcceptanceReview.2.pdf,p27,0,BASS SUCCESS CRITERIA • Minimal Success: 20 total tests including: eight tests with flat samples (four materials at two different flow speeds); four tests with spherical PMMA samples (four different flow speeds with nitrogen extinguishment); four tests with candles (four different flow speeds with nitrogen extinguishment); and four tests of PMMA wake flames (four different flow speeds with nitrogen extinguishment). • Complete Success: 60 flames as indicated in test matrix. 6/16/2010 27,,False
