PSI-26,Engineering Documents,PSI-26_Engineering Documents_BASS_SysAcceptanceReview.2.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-26/Engineering Documents/PSI-26_Engineering Documents_BASS_SysAcceptanceReview.2.pdf,p40,0,"Mission Assurance • Project Quality Assessment • Product Assurance Plan (SpaceDOC PAP) • Conducted Quality, Risks, M&P and Safety Audit. • Successfully completed the Safety and Mission Assurance Organizational Review Board conducted. • MIUL/MUA – Material certification letter in signature loop. • EEE parts risk assessment • PACE-2 uses industrial grade COTS parts. • GIDEP Alert searches: One hit dispositioned. 6/16/2010 40",,False
