PSI-26,Engineering Documents,PSI-26_Engineering Documents_Drawing_SPICE Housing.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-26/Engineering Documents/PSI-26_Engineering Documents_Drawing_SPICE Housing.pdf,p1,2,"18.5 (basic) - .500-20 UNF-2B INCH THRU, ⌖ Ø0.4 | A | B | C Side view (left): - 163.7; 117; 51.6 (basic); 108 (basic); 54 (basic); 51 (basic); 3 (basic); 11.7 (basic); 4X 34 (=136) - 4X R0.8/0.2; 2X 8.3/7.7; 2X 21.3/20.7; 2X 3.3/2.7 - 4X M3 X 0.5-6H ↧ 6-7, ⌖ Ø0.2 | B | A | C - 5X M3 X 0.5-6H ↧ 6-7, ⌖ Ø0.2 | B | A | C Section A-A: - 2X 93 (basic); 76.2 (basic, two places); 3.7; 2X 3 (basic); 13 (basic); 6 (basic); 5 - 3X R13 (basic); R2.5 (basic); R1 MAX; R0.3 MAX - Profile ⌓ 0.3 | B | A | D - M3 X 0.5-6H THRU, ⌖ Ø0.2 | B | D | K, BOTH SIDES Side view (right, with cavity window): - 80.8 (basic, two places); 40 (basic, two places); 20.62 (basic, two places); 16 (basic); 65 (basic); 3 (basic); 11.7 (basic); 4X 34 (=136) - Ø20.87/20.62 THRU TO CAVITY, ⌖ Ø0.5Ⓜ | J | A | C (datum L) - 9X M3 X 0.5-6H ↧ 6-7, ⌖ Ø0.2 | J | IⓂ [?] | HⓂ - 4X M3 X 0.5-6H THRU, ⌖ Ø0.2 | J | LⓂ | A - 5X M3 X 0.5-6H ↧ 6-7, ⌖ Ø0.2 | J | A | C End view: - 197; 98.5 (basic); 84 (basic); 78; 9 (basic); 12; 4X R13/11 - 191 with ⌖ 0.5Ⓜ | C | EⓂ | A - 6X M3 X 0.5-6H ↧ 6-7, ⌖ Ø0.2 | C | A | EⓂ",,True
