PSI-26,Engineering Documents,PSI-26_Engineering Documents_Drawing_Blk.PMMA.Rod.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-26/Engineering Documents/PSI-26_Engineering Documents_Drawing_Blk.PMMA.Rod.pdf,p1,1,"| ITEM | QTY | PART NUMBER | DESCRIPTION | |---|---|---|---| | 1 | 1 | S1183MFD1036 | WAX-WICK SAMPLE ARM | | 2 | 1 | S1183MFD1091 (flag 5) | BLACK PMMA ROD SAMPLE | ### Commercial part list | ITEM | QTY | MIL SPEC/VENDOR PART NUMBER | DESCRIPTION | |---|---|---|---| | C1 | A/R | ITW DEVCON: 14355 | 2-TON CLEAR EPOXY RESIN | | C2 | 1 | 4744-S | BITRAN BAG | ### Notes 1. CERTIFICATE OF CONFORMANCE REQUIRED FOR ALL COMMERCIAL PARTS. 2. HANDLE WITH CLEAN LINT-FREE GLOVES. 3. (flag) APPLY EPOXY ADHESIVE COMPOUND (ITEM C1) BETWEEN COMPONENTS OF ASSEMBLY, TAKING CARE NOT TO HAVE ANY BLEED TO THE OUTER EDGES OF THE COMPONENTS BEING BONDED TOGETHER. DO NOT DISTURB FOR THE RECOMMENDED CURING TIME OF THE ADHESIVE COMPOUND. 4. BEFORE STORAGE, PROTECT WITH BITRAN BAG (ITEM C2). TRIM BAG TO FIT USING BAG SEALER. IDENTIFY PART BY TAGGING WITH PART NUMBER AND SERIAL/LOT NUMBER AS SPECIFIED IN WORK ORDER PER SAE AS478, METHOD 35. 5. (flag) THIS ASSEMBLY 25S1183MFA1090 HAS INTERCHANGEABLE PARTS (S1183MFD1091) WITH VARIOUS DIAMETERS. SEE TABULATED TABLE THIS DWG. AND ALSO TABLE ON DWG S1183MFD1091. ### Dimensions (reference, mm unless noted) - Arm mounting tab: (28.7) overall width, (3.3) hole offset from edge, (25.4) tab height, (19.1) hole spacing - Overall assembly length: (78.0) - Rod sample exposed length (side view): (57.28) - Arm thickness (side view): (2) - Rod diameter: ØA (INCH), flag 5 — see table - Balloons: 1 (sample arm), 2 (rod), 3 / C1 (epoxy at joint) ### Tabulated diameters",,True
