PSI-39,Science Documents,PSI-39_Science Documents_CFI_DataSummary_Spreadsheet_Jan2021.xlsx,data/raw/files/PSI-39/Science Documents/PSI-39_Science Documents_CFI_DataSummary_Spreadsheet_Jan2021.xlsx,sheet Comments,0,sheet Comments: 228 non-empty rows header: Flex Number | Comments | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | row 1: 1206 | Excellent deployment. Ignition just before igniters pull away. Droplet drifts W in color camera FOV but stays in FOV the entire time. Hot flame extinguishers without oscillations. Long cool flame burn with large vapor cloud. No evidence of cool flame extinction (droplet seems to disappear). | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | row 2: 1207 | Good deployment on fiber. Only a little motion on the fiber. Short hot flame with no flame oscillations. Nice stable droplet behavior on fiber. Long cool flame burn with no large vapor cloud. No visible cool flame extinction (droplet disappears). | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | row 3: 1208 | IPSUG did not switch to continuous mode. This means we will get almost no hot or cool flame data from the intensified camera. Burn almost identical to last test. Good deployment and ignition on fiber. No motion on fiber during test. Hot flame burns 5-10 sec before extinguishing with no oscillations. Long cool flame burn and large vapor cloud. No cool flame extinction evident - droplet burns to near completion. | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | row 4: 1209 | IPSUG did not switch to continuous mode. This means we will not get any hot or cool flame images from the intensified camera. Burn almost identical to last test. Good deployment and ignition ob fiber.,,False
PSI-39,Science Documents,PSI-39_Science Documents_CFI_DataSummary_Spreadsheet_Jan2021.xlsx,data/raw/files/PSI-39/Science Documents/PSI-39_Science Documents_CFI_DataSummary_Spreadsheet_Jan2021.xlsx,sheet Comments,1,Very little droplet motion on fiber. 5-10 sec hot-flame burn with no oscilations. Long cool flame burn and large vapor cloud. Again no evidence of residual droplet after cool flame extinction. | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | row 5: 1210 | IPSUG did not switch to continuous mode. This means there will not be any visable hot or cool flame imagers from the intensified camera. Burn almost identical to last test. Good deployment and ignition on fiber. Very little droplet motion on fiber. 5-10 sec hot flame burn with no oscillations before extinction. Long cool flame burn and large vapor cloud. No evidence of residual droplet indicating cool flame extinction. | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | |,,False
