PSI-47,Analyzed Data,PSI-47_Analyzed Data_DAFT Flight Data GMT053.xls,data/raw/files/PSI-47/Analyzed Data/PSI-47_Analyzed Data_DAFT Flight Data GMT053.xls,sheet text,0,"sheet text: 1 non-empty rows header: On GMT053 Leroy set up the P-Trak and the DustTrak to take a sample of the air near express rack 4. Everything went smoothly during operations. We have looked at the data and video. The video was very helpful; we used it to sync up the times for each instrument with respect to the HEPA filter and sample hose. As seen in the results plotted in the attachment, the readings on both instruments were reading low. They, however, seem credible based on the information we have been told about filter changing on the ISS and the readings we have been getting in our lab where there is a humidifier running. In order to get some results that can be used to compare the P-Trak and DustTrak readings, it is necessary to have particle readings above what we have already sampled.",,False
