PSI-100,Science Documents,PSI-100_Science Documents_SAFFIRE-III Image Directory Nomenclature_v3.0.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-100/Science Documents/PSI-100_Science Documents_SAFFIRE-III Image Directory Nomenclature_v3.0.pdf,p1,0,"SAFFIRE-III Image Directory Nomenclature SAFFIRE-III_Image_Data_Package Contents Version 3.0 Bit F1 F2 S1 S2 XnCn_Raw_CamOriginal Camera original RAW files recorded on-board and downlinked on command. Contains 8-byte offset that must be processed prior to color interpolation and distribution. This data set is archived at NASA-GRC. XnCn_Raw_DistroMaster RAW Camara Orginal files processed for 8-byte offset using ImageJ, and resaved using originial file name. This is the RAW Distribution Master set for Science Team distribution and color interpolation (demosaicing). X X X X Xn_Raw2TIFF TIFF images of the RAW Distribution Master files, color interpolated (demosaiced) using IrfanView Batch Conversion process. X X X X Xn_Raw2TIFF_icmad Raw2TIFF files annotated with ICMAD 'Exposure' and 'Gain' information. Data is appended to the bottom of each frame using ImageMagick script and resaved as TIFF. X X Xn_jpeg Jpeg images created on-board SAFFIRE payload and downlinked by command X X X X Xn_jpeg_corrupt Jpeg images received corrupted after downlink. X X X X Xn_jpeg2png_icmad Jpeg images annotated with ICMAD 'Exposure' and 'Gain' information. Data is appended to the bottom of each frame using ImageMagick script and re-saved as .png format to minimize additional compression artifacts. X X ""Xn"" Denotes run type and number ""Cn"" Denotes camera number (if sorted separately)",,False
