PSI-101,Presentations,PSI-101_Presentations_SAME-R_Particle Morphology and Size Results from the Smoke Aerosol Measurement Experiment-2.pptx,data/raw/files/PSI-101/Presentations/PSI-101_Presentations_SAME-R_Particle Morphology and Size Results from the Smoke Aerosol Measurement Experiment-2.pptx,slide 49,0,49 SAME Raw Data Silicone Rubber: Note difference in Dust Traks indicating large particles Teflon: Note similarity in Dust Traks indicating smaller particles Two Dust Traks were used one with a 10 micron cut off and one with a 1 micron cutoff. The difference between the two gives an indication of the particle size distribution.,,False
