PSI-101,Science Documents,PSI-101_Science Documents_SAME_Operations Manual_007.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-101/Science Documents/PSI-101_Science Documents_SAME_Operations Manual_007.pdf,p26,0,"SAME-DOC-007 21 Change Time Constant for Survey Mode Display # Description Next Button Press or Reaction 5 Survey Mode Increment Time Constant 20,21,22,23, or 24 Shows current time constant setting waits 1 second 21,22,23,24, or 20 Shows new time constant setting waits 5 seconds 5 Survey Mode Change the calibration factor Display # Description Next Button Press or Reaction 5 Survey Mode Calibrate 14 Countdown from 5 to 0 After 0, goes to next display 15 Calibrate or Zero selection screen Calibrate 16 Calibration Up 17 Calibration increases Down 18 Calibration decreases Start/Stop Sampling (exit while saving new calibration factor) or Calibrate (exit without saving) 5 Survey Mode Zero the measurement Display # Description Next Button Press or Reaction 5 Survey Mode Calibrate 14 Countdown from 5 to 0 After 0, goes to next display 15 Calibrate or Zero selection screen Start/Stop Sampling 19 Countdown from 60 to 0 After 0, goes to next display 5 Survey Mode View Log Interval for Log Mode 1, 2, or 3 Display # Description Next Button Press or Reaction 6,7,or 8 Log Mode 1, 2, or 3 View Log Interval 25,26,27,28, or 29 Shows current log interval setting waits 5 seconds 6,7, or 8 Log Mode 1, 2, or 3",,False
PSI-101,Science Documents,PSI-101_Science Documents_SAME_Operations Manual_007.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-101/Science Documents/PSI-101_Science Documents_SAME_Operations Manual_007.pdf,p26,1,"Change the Log Interval in Log Mode 1, 2, or 3 Display # Description Next Button Press or Reaction 6,7, or 8 Log Mode 1,2,or 3 Increment Log Interval 25,26,27,28,or 29 Shows current log interval setting waits 1 second 26,27,28,29 or 25 Shows new log interval setting waits 5 seconds 6,7, or 8 Log Mode 1,2,or 3",,False
