PSI-102,Engineering Documents,PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHD126-B Smoke Generation Tube.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-102/Engineering Documents/PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHD126-B Smoke Generation Tube.pdf,p1,4,"### Section A-A - R .06 ALL AROUND; R.060 ALL AROUND; R .005 ALL AROUND; R.020 ALL AROUND - .125; .130 +.002/-.000; datum D - Ø1.200 +.002/-.000, position Ø.010 D C A - Angles 90° and 140° ### Section B-B (SCALE: 2/1) - Ø.360 (two places); .100; .100 - 36° TOOL ANGLE (two places), flag 3 - 3.50 ZONE, flags 4 and 6",,True
PSI-102,Engineering Documents,PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHD509 P-Trak Condenser Tube Modification.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-102/Engineering Documents/PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHD509 P-Trak Condenser Tube Modification.pdf,p1,0,"Description: C-size modification drawing of an existing P-Trak condenser tube: a flanged tube whose bore is machined with 60 fine longitudinal knife-edge grooves. Section A-A (side), end view, Detail B (groove profile, scale 50/1) and Detail C (grooved bore end, scale 8/1). ### Title block - Title: P-TRAK CONDENSER TUBE MODIFICATION; next assembly: P-TRAK ASSEMBLY 60089MFHA500 - Drawing number: 60089MFHD509, size C, rev - (no revision letter; revisions table empty) - Organisation: National Aeronautics and Space Administration, John H. Glenn Research Center, Lewis Field, Cleveland, Ohio; ZIN Technologies - Project lead, quality, engineer, designer, reviewer: [name omitted], dated 6/21/05 to 6/22/05; safety: NA - Contract number: NAS3-99154; delivery order: MRDOC-074; file location: M:\MRDOC\60089_074; CAD package: Pro/E Wildfire - Scale 4/1; initial release date 6/22/05; sheet 1 of 1; bldg ZIN; area GRC; units: inch; discipline: mechanical - ""This drawing is under configuration control: do not revise without approved ECO"". Approved: [name omitted], date 6/22/05 ### Tolerances (unless otherwise specified, dimensions in inches) | | | |---|---| | .X | ± 0.03 | | .XX | ± 0.01 | | .XXX | ± 0.005 | | FRACTION | ± - | | ANGULAR | ± 0.50° | | BREAK EDGES | N/A | Dimensioning and tolerancing per ASME Y14.5M-1994.",,True
PSI-102,Engineering Documents,PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHD509 P-Trak Condenser Tube Modification.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-102/Engineering Documents/PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHD509 P-Trak Condenser Tube Modification.pdf,p1,1,"### Notes 1. EXISTING P-TRAK CONDENSER TUBE NO. 3001737-8, MODIFY AS SHOWN WHILE PROTECTING ALL OTHER EXISTING SURFACES FROM ANY DAMAGE. (MATL: ALUMINUM). 2. 16 Ra ALL MACHINED SURFACES. 3. CLEAN SURFACES WITH ISOPROPYL OR ETHYL ALCOHOL. AIR DRY. WIPE WITH CLEAN COTTON SWABS AND/OR LINT-FREE CLOTH. 4. HANDLE WITH CLEAN LINT FREE GLOVES. 5. BEFORE STORAGE, PROTECT WITH CONTAMINATION BARRIER. USE CLEAN, NEW, TRANSPARENT POLYETHYLENE BAG FOR SMALL ITEMS, OR 4 MIL THICK MINIMUM POLYETHYLENE SHEET AND SEAL. IDENTIFY BY TAGGING WITH PART NUMBER AND SERIAL/LOT NUMBER AS SPECIFIED IN WORK ORDER, PER SAE AS478, METHOD 35. ### Section A-A (dimensions in inches) - Overall length (1.438); grooved length 1.375 - Flange thickness (.080); (.050) - Tube outer diameter (Ø.307); bore (Ø.188); (Ø.250) - ""SEE DETAIL C"" at the grooved end ### End view - (Ø.376), (Ø.997) flange; ""SEE DETAIL B""; section line A-A ### Detail B (60 PLACES EQUALLY SPACED, SCALE 50/1) - Groove depth .0095/.0090 - R.0015 MAX at groove root - 30°0' and 60°0' groove angles - SHARP CORNERS (KNIFE EDGES) ### Detail C (SCALE 8/1) - 60X R.250 [?]; (1.375) grooved length",,True
