PSI-102,Engineering Documents,PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHA417-B Kapton Sample Assembly.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-102/Engineering Documents/PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHA417-B Kapton Sample Assembly.pdf,p1,1,"### Notes 1. (flag) SAMPLE (ITEM C1) IS ROLLED UP AND PLACED INSIDE OF THE COILS. 2. HANDLE WITH CLEAN LINT FREE GLOVES. 3. BEFORE STORAGE, PROTECT WITH CONTAMINATION BARRIER. USE CLEAN, NEW, TRANSPARENT POLYETHYLENE BAG FOR SMALL ITEMS OR 4 MIL THICK MINIMUM POLYETHYLENE SHEET AND SEAL. IDENTIFY PART BY TAGGING WITH PART NUMBER AND SERIAL/LOT NUMBER AS SPECIFIED IN WORK ORDER PER SAE AS478, METHOD 35. ### Drawing list | ITEM | QTY | DRAWING NUMBER | DESCRIPTION | |---|---|---|---| | 1 | 1 | 60089MFHA432 | KAPTON IGNITOR WIRE COIL ASSEMBLY | ### Commercial parts list | ITEM | QTY | PART NUMBER | DESCRIPTION | |---|---|---|---| | C1 | 1 | N/A | .005 THICK X .50 WIDE X 2.0 LG KAPTON FILM | ### Callouts on the views - C1 with flag 1 (rolled sample inside coil); 1 (ignitor wire coil assembly)",,True
