PSI-102,Engineering Documents,PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHA432-A Kapton Ignitor Wire Coil Assembly.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-102/Engineering Documents/PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHA432-A Kapton Ignitor Wire Coil Assembly.pdf,p1,1,"### Notes 1. MATERIAL: TYPE 304 STAINLESS STEEL SAFETY LOCKWIRE (.020 DIA), McMASTER-CARR PART No 8860K12 AND AS NOTED IN FIELD OF DRAWING. CERTIFICATE OF CONFORMANCE REQUIRED. 2. CLEAN ALL SURFACES WITH ISOPROPYL OR ETHYL ALCOHOL AND LET AIR DRY. WIPE WITH CLEAN COTTON SWABS AND/OR LINT FREE CLOTH. 3. HANDLE WITH CLEAN LINT FREE GLOVES. 4. BEFORE STORAGE, PROTECT WITH CONTAMINATION BARRIER. USE CLEAN, NEW, TRANSPARENT POLYETHYLENE BAG FOR SMALL ITEMS OR 4 MIL THICK MINIMUM POLYETHYLENE SHEET AND SEAL. IDENTIFY PART BY TAGGING WITH PART NUMBER AND SERIAL/LOT NUMBER AS SPECIFIED IN WORK ORDER PER SAE AS478, METHOD 35. ### Field of drawing (dimensions in inches) - Ø.020 WIRE FORMED AS SHOWN, PITCH 20/INCH, APPROX 8 COILS, Ø.220 ID - Coil length (.375); lead spacing .31; .033 - End view: (Ø.220); 6X R.06; 2X .44; 2X .69 - SIZE 22D CONNECTOR PIN, ALLIED ELECTRONICS PART No. 512-9156/204370-2, CRIMPED ON WIRE LEAD, 2 REQD",,True
