PSI-102,Engineering Documents,PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHA410-A Teflon Sample Assembly.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-102/Engineering Documents/PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHA410-A Teflon Sample Assembly.pdf,p1,1,"### Notes 1. HANDLE WITH CLEAN LINT FREE GLOVES. 2. BEFORE STORAGE, PROTECT WITH CONTAMINATION BARRIER. USE CLEAN, NEW, TRANSPARENT POLYETHYLENE BAG FOR SMALL ITEMS OR 4 MIL THICK MINIMUM POLYETHYLENE SHEET AND SEAL. IDENTIFY PART BY TAGGING WITH PART NUMBER AND SERIAL/LOT NUMBER AS SPECIFIED IN WORK ORDER PER SAE AS478, METHOD 35. ### Drawing list | ITEM | QTY | DRAWING NUMBER | DESCRIPTION | |---|---|---|---| | 1 | 1 | 60089MFHA411 | TEFLON IGNITOR WIRE COIL ASSEMBLY | | 2 | 1 | 60089MFHD413 | TEFLON SAMPLE PART | ### Field of drawing - Lead spacing (.31) (inches) - Balloons 2 (Teflon sample inside coil) and 1 (coil assembly)",,True
