PSI-102,Engineering Documents,PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHD413 Teflon Sample Part.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-102/Engineering Documents/PSI-102_Engineering Documents_60089MFHD413 Teflon Sample Part.pdf,p1,1,"### Notes 1. MATERIAL: .1875 DIA TEFLON ROD, Mc MASTER-CARR PART No 8546K32. CERTIFICATE OF CONFORMANCE REQUIRED. 2. 32 Ra ALL MACHINED SURFACES PER ANSI/ASME B46.1. 3. CLEAN SURFACES WITH NON-DEODORANT, NONADDITIVE SOAP AND WATER. AIR DRY. WIPE WITH CLEAN COTTON SWABS AND/OR LINT-FREE CLOTH. 4. HANDLE WITH CLEAN LINT FREE GLOVES. 5. BEFORE STORAGE, PROTECT WITH CONTAMINATION BARRIER. USE CLEAN, NEW, TRANSPARENT POLYETHYLENE BAG FOR SMALL ITEMS OR 4 MIL THICK MINIMUM POLYETHYLENE SHEET AND SEAL. IDENTIFY PART BY TAGGING WITH PART NUMBER AND SERIAL/LOT NUMBER AS SPECIFIED IN WORK ORDER PER SAE AS478, METHOD 35. 6. ESTIMATED WEIGHT= 0.010 LB. ### Field of drawing (dimensions in inches) - Length .50 - Diameter (Ø.1875) - .190-32 UNF-2A THREAD",,True
