PSI-102,Science Documents,PSI-102_Science Documents_SAME_Operations Manual_007.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-102/Science Documents/PSI-102_Science Documents_SAME_Operations Manual_007.pdf,p26,1,"Change the Log Interval in Log Mode 1, 2, or 3 Display # Description Next Button Press or Reaction 6,7, or 8 Log Mode 1,2,or 3 Increment Log Interval 25,26,27,28,or 29 Shows current log interval setting waits 1 second 26,27,28,29 or 25 Shows new log interval setting waits 5 seconds 6,7, or 8 Log Mode 1,2,or 3",,False
