PSI-117,Presentations,PSI-117_Presentations_Three_Stage_Cool_Flame_TFarouk.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-117/Presentations/PSI-117_Presentations_Three_Stage_Cool_Flame_TFarouk.pdf,p20,0,"20 High Pressure Helium Exchange – 5 atm Evolution of peak temperature (n-heptane, do = 4.00 mm, XO2 = 21%, He exchange with balance N2, 5 atm). Evolution of flame standoff ratio (n-heptane, do = 4.00 mm, XO2 = 21%, He exchange with balance N2, 5 atm). Similar stable three stage burning behavior is observed at increased pressure, but under higher helium loading conditions 1st Stage High Temperature burn 2nd Stage Moderate Temperature burn Tflame ~ 950 K 3rd Stage Low Temperature burn Tflame ~ 770 K",,False
