PSI-159,Raw Data,PSI-159_Raw Data_21130 flow traces etc.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-159/Raw Data/PSI-159_Raw Data_21130 flow traces etc.pdf,p1,0,"CFI-G Round 1, day 6 with 30% propane (C3H8) Testing with 30% n-butane had earlier been planned for this test day, but a labeling error instead led to the installation of the 30% propane Chamber filled to 2 atm with ~21% O2 (balance N2) Extinction detection effectively turned off so tests were ended ‘manually’ Test 21130A1 (test 1 of 24, hot flame 1 of 15) – momentary hot flame, run as planned Console data wasn’t captured in time because personnel were working to set up video on the science console at the time After test: 951 on lowest valve safety timer, 1187 psia in oxidizer bottle, 152 psia in fuel bottle 1",,False
