PSI-159,Raw Data,PSI-159_Raw Data_21291 test sheets.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-159/Raw Data/PSI-159_Raw Data_21291 test sheets.pdf,p1,0,"ACME / CFI-G (normal flame) - Science Test Sheet Test date: Oct. 18, 2021 Local time: 1:52 GMT: 21 291 17:52 ACME test #: 21291A1 Test of day #: 1 Flame of day #: 1 sustained — note: Hot (written in left margin) Rack Officer (RO): [name omitted] DMO (CIR): [name omitted] PD (ACME): [name omitted] Researcher: [name omitted] TEST CONDITIONS Control?: fully automated Test type?: standard Oxygen conc.: ~40 % (vol, nominal) Oxygen conc.: 39.93 % (vol, per calc) Chamber pressure: 29.4 psia (CIR avg) — note: per FCU Vent before?: yes, to 0.2 psia 'Air' added?: yes, to 29.4 psia Also just before?: not marked Fuel bottle (next row): n-C4H10 30% Burner fuel conc.: 30 % (volume) Fuel flow rate: 0.233 slpm (N2 basis) N2 flow rate: 0 slpm [label ""N2 flow rate"" struck through] — note: no N2 INSTRUMENTATION TFP?: no Gain: 33 DataCam 31 ops camera DataCam [ticked]: filter? clear; ROI? full; fps: Intensified [ticked]: filter? CH2O [underlined]; ROI? full; 23 fps HiBMs [not ticked; label struck through]: backlight filter? yes — note: no HiBMs CIR backlight?: no fps?: [struck: 15 / 30] FLAME BEHAVIOR Flame: hot, cool Flame: hole/opening, partially detached Flame: oscillating, unsteady Out: not marked — note: intentionally stopped Ignited?: yes — note: repeatedly, 6x Soot@ignition: lots Soot@middle: not marked [""little"" and ""lots"" circled together] — note: between Soot@end: little POST-TEST CONDITIONS Oxygen conc.: 38.99 % (vol, per calc) Valve safety timer: 816 sec Chamber pressure:",,True
PSI-159,Raw Data,PSI-159_Raw Data_21291 test sheets.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-159/Raw Data/PSI-159_Raw Data_21291 test sheets.pdf,p1,1,"29.4 psia (CIR avg) — note: per FCU Oxidizer bottle pressure: 637 psia Fuel bottle pressure: 42 psia GENERAL COMMENTS - run as planned, without changes to parameters - sooty w/ escape at start of test - hot flame extinguished & reignited repeatedly until we simply stopped the fuel flow - reignition tended to asymmetric and aligned with the closest thermocouple Form date: 24 March 2021",,True
PSI-159,Raw Data,PSI-159_Raw Data_21291 test sheets.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-159/Raw Data/PSI-159_Raw Data_21291 test sheets.pdf,p2,0,"ACME / CFI-G (normal flame) - Science Test Sheet Test date: Oct. 18, 2021 Local time: 2:33 GMT: 21 291 18:33 ACME test #: 21291C1 Test of day #: 2 Flame of day #: 2 sustained — note: Hot (written in left margin) Rack Officer (RO): [name omitted] DMO (CIR): [name omitted] PD (ACME): [name omitted] Researcher: [name omitted] TEST CONDITIONS Control?: fully automated Test type?: standard Oxygen conc.: ~40 % (vol, nominal) Oxygen conc.: 38.99 % (vol, per calc) Chamber pressure: 29.4 psia (CIR avg) — note: per FCU Vent before?: no 'Air' added?: no Also just before?: fan Fuel bottle (next row): n-C4H10 30% Burner fuel conc.: 30 % (volume) Fuel flow rate: 0.155 slpm (N2 basis) N2 flow rate: 0 slpm [label ""N2 flow rate"" struck through] — note: no N2 INSTRUMENTATION TFP?: no Gain: 33 DataCam 31 ops camera DataCam [ticked]: filter? clear; ROI? full; fps: Intensified [ticked; label struck through ?]: filter? CH2O [CH* ticked and scribbled out]; ROI? full; 23 fps HiBMs [not ticked; label struck through]: backlight filter? yes — note: no HiBMs CIR backlight?: no fps?: [struck: 15 / 30] FLAME BEHAVIOR Flame: hot, cool Flame: hole/opening, partially detached Flame: oscillating, unsteady Out: time out [underlined; ""ext. detect"" ticked and struck through] Ignited?: yes — note: repeatedly, 6x Soot@ignition: lots Soot@middle: little Soot@end: none, little [both ticked and circled together] POST-TEST CONDITIONS Oxygen conc.: 38.09 % (vol, per calc) Valve safety timer: 555 sec Chamber pressure:",,True
PSI-159,Raw Data,PSI-159_Raw Data_21291 test sheets.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-159/Raw Data/PSI-159_Raw Data_21291 test sheets.pdf,p2,1,"29.6 psia (CIR avg) — note: per FCU Oxidizer bottle pressure: 641 psia Fuel bottle pressure: 38 psia GENERAL COMMENTS - a flow variant of A1, run as planned except for a 5-s test exposure for the ACME datacam - Sooty at moment of ignition, then blue, then sooty - Similar to A1 w/ repeated ignitions & extinctions of hot flames with cool flames between - asymmetric reignition aligned w/ closest thermocouple Form date: 24 March 2021",,True
