PSI-159,Raw Data,PSI-159_Raw Data_21291 test sheets.pdf,data/raw/files/PSI-159/Raw Data/PSI-159_Raw Data_21291 test sheets.pdf,p3,1,"35 psia GENERAL COMMENTS - a flow variant of A1+C1, but with a 0.1-s DataCam test exposure - Sooty with escape at test start - cool flame evidence at closest thermocouple tip after hot flame extinction (""closest"" inserted with a caret) type B thermocouple includes platinum, a catalyst Form date: 24 March 2021",,True
